WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 7=

5
02:02.940 --> 02:05.420
(Zhang Renjing)

6
02:09.340 --> 02:11.980
(Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing)

7
02:25.740 --> 02:29.380
(Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing, Xu Mianmian)

8
02:43.500 --> 02:46.740
(Luling, Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing)

9
02:51.220 --> 02:55.060
(Luling, Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing, Xu Mianmian)

10
03:00.980 --> 03:04.220
(Luling, Yu Cheng'an, Zhang Renjing, Xu Mianmian)

11
03:39.560 --> 03:41.330
The good times are almost here.

12
03:43.330 --> 03:43.970
What do you mean?

13
03:47.250 --> 03:48.000
In a few days,

14
03:48.720 --> 03:49.970
Sigui Garden in Jinchang Ward

15
03:50.330 --> 03:51.330
will host the Peony Festival.

16
03:52.280 --> 03:52.810
Didn't you know?

17
04:03.090 --> 04:03.650
I know.

18
04:06.820 --> 04:11.620
(Five Days Before the Peony Festival)

19
04:12.020 --> 04:15.660
(Sigui Garden)

20
04:18.160 --> 04:18.570
Sir,

21
04:19.570 --> 04:20.800
are you here to see the black peony?

22
04:21.600 --> 04:22.240
You're too early.

23
04:22.800 --> 04:24.010
They won't bloom for a few more days.

24
04:25.240 --> 04:26.010
Thank you for letting me know.

25
04:53.620 --> 04:55.620
♪A rough-cut gem, held close to heart♪

26
04:56.855 --> 05:02.325
♪Lean bamboo bones, yet mountain-bold♪

27
05:02.691 --> 05:05.191
♪Books bear no blade♪

28
05:06.420 --> 05:11.050
♪Yet tens of thousands of scrolls can pierce the sky♪

29
05:11.980 --> 05:14.047
♪My body is the furnace, flames reach the clouds♪

30
05:14.048 --> 05:14.780
(Young Yan Shang)

31
05:14.840 --> 05:16.770
Mother, there's a well hidden here!

32
05:17.040 --> 05:19.010
Didn't Brother say he was thirsty from walking?

33
05:19.010 --> 05:21.720
♪Winds gather, then drift apart♪

34
05:21.720 --> 05:22.650
Come, Shang.

35
05:23.090 --> 05:24.090
I'll draw some water for you both.

36
05:27.130 --> 05:27.770
Here, have some.

37
05:28.160 --> 05:28.600
Thank you, Mother.

38
05:28.820 --> 05:30.460
♪In all I do, I have no regrets♪ (Young Yan Dalang)

39
05:32.040 --> 05:32.530
Mother,

40
05:33.090 --> 05:34.720
when will the black peony bloom?

41
05:35.210 --> 05:36.480
(Xie Jinghui, Yan Shang's Mother) We've come a little too early.

42
05:37.210 --> 05:38.890
But even without the famous flowers,

43
05:39.690 --> 05:40.330
just look around,

44
05:40.970 --> 05:43.400
the garden is so peaceful, with clouds reflected in the water...

45
05:44.010 --> 05:45.040
It's beautiful all the same.

46
05:46.800 --> 05:48.160
♪Who'll wait with me for the boat home?♪

47
05:48.160 --> 05:49.400
Mother, look! A butterfly!

48
05:51.200 --> 05:53.360
♪By noon, the mist will lift♪

49
05:53.460 --> 05:55.760
♪Rivers will bend♪

50
05:56.160 --> 05:59.400
♪I'll take the open road and journey home♪

51
06:00.630 --> 06:05.300
♪With rosy clouds, I bid the moon goodnight♪

52
06:06.000 --> 06:08.960
♪And trade my old robes for new♪

53
07:02.330 --> 07:03.480
Xu Mianmian.

54
07:05.330 --> 07:06.090
Luling.

55
07:07.840 --> 07:08.570
Luling...

56
07:12.800 --> 07:13.530
Greetings, sir.

57
07:16.240 --> 07:17.629
So early in the morning,

58
07:17.671 --> 07:21.181
and you're already strolling through the garden?

59
07:21.890 --> 07:22.840
You certainly know how to enjoy yourself.

60
07:23.530 --> 07:24.450
Something's troubling me.

61
07:25.240 --> 07:26.010
I'm just wandering around.

62
07:30.720 --> 07:32.210
Since you're in no hurry,

63
07:32.400 --> 07:35.480
would you care to play a game of Go with me?

64
07:37.280 --> 07:37.920
I'd be happy to.

65
07:38.650 --> 07:40.240
But we have no Go board here,

66
07:40.480 --> 07:41.090
nor any stones.

67
07:42.690 --> 07:45.130
Let the mind be our board and our thoughts the stones.

68
07:45.400 --> 07:47.210
Who needs physical pieces?

69
07:48.160 --> 07:50.360
Would you care to join me

70
07:50.840 --> 07:52.360
for a game of Go without a board?

71
07:54.840 --> 07:56.130
(He's here for me.)

72
07:58.920 --> 07:59.650
(Who is he?)

73
08:00.240 --> 08:01.160
(Why me?)

74
08:02.160 --> 08:02.570
In that case,

75
08:03.240 --> 08:04.450
I'd be honored.

76
08:05.010 --> 08:07.090
Upper 6-3, corner approach.

77
08:07.360 --> 08:08.770
Upper 8-3, pincer attack.

78
08:09.210 --> 08:10.650
Upper 7-4, diagonal move.

79
08:11.040 --> 08:11.530
Upper...

80
08:12.650 --> 08:13.570
8-4, attachment.

81
08:14.360 --> 08:17.970
So young, yet you play by the book.

82
08:19.450 --> 08:20.650
Upper 7-6, jump.

83
08:21.970 --> 08:23.720
Judging by your clothes,

84
08:24.480 --> 08:26.330
you're preparing for the imperial exams.

85
08:26.480 --> 08:29.600
I imagine you're hoping to pass with flying colors.

86
08:29.920 --> 08:30.280
Am I right?

87
08:32.290 --> 08:33.570
Upper 4-2, jump.

88
08:34.640 --> 08:35.290
To tell you the truth, sir,

89
08:36.120 --> 08:36.880
I came to the capital

90
08:37.720 --> 08:38.760
not to seek fame or office.

91
08:41.360 --> 08:42.810
Upper 5-2, diagonal move.

92
08:43.090 --> 08:43.720
Then why?

93
08:44.360 --> 08:45.240
Upper 3-7.

94
08:46.090 --> 08:47.240
I came to right

95
08:47.840 --> 08:48.640
a terrible wrong.

96
08:49.600 --> 08:51.120
Upper 8-5, hane.

97
08:52.840 --> 08:53.480
Young man,

98
08:53.970 --> 08:54.810
do you realize

99
08:55.290 --> 08:56.360
that in Sheng'an,

100
08:56.930 --> 08:58.210
wolves are in power,

101
08:58.520 --> 08:59.570
and injustices are

102
09:00.480 --> 09:02.410
far too many to count?

103
09:05.240 --> 09:06.210
Upper 6-5, peep.

104
09:06.720 --> 09:07.970
Then I'll right one if I can.

105
09:09.840 --> 09:10.930
Well said.

106
09:11.480 --> 09:12.880
You know there's a tiger on the mountain,

107
09:13.290 --> 09:15.240
yet you head straight toward it.

108
09:16.360 --> 09:17.170
What courage!

109
09:18.640 --> 09:20.880
Upper 7-5, connect.

110
09:21.520 --> 09:22.290
Careful, sir.

111
09:23.330 --> 09:24.210
3-9.

112
09:27.240 --> 09:28.810
That's an excellent move!

113
09:29.760 --> 09:31.810
Upper 3-2, net.

114
09:40.210 --> 09:41.330
Got you!

115
09:45.970 --> 09:46.810
Greetings, Chancellor Liu.

116
09:51.450 --> 09:52.640
My respects, Chancellor.

117
09:53.450 --> 09:54.480
Forgive my earlier discourtesy.

118
09:55.170 --> 09:56.360
I meant no disrespect.

119
09:57.690 --> 09:59.410
You two, honestly!

120
10:00.450 --> 10:02.360
Your timing couldn't be worse!

121
10:02.640 --> 10:05.290
The game was just getting interesting.

122
10:06.640 --> 10:07.690
Never mind. Let's go.

123
10:13.810 --> 10:14.450
Young man,

124
10:15.570 --> 10:16.480
don't forget,

125
10:17.240 --> 10:18.720
you and I still have

126
10:19.120 --> 10:20.570
an unfinished game.

127
10:24.000 --> 10:24.480
Yes.

128
10:55.640 --> 10:56.120
Scissors.

129
11:02.720 --> 11:03.840
What are you grinning about?

130
11:07.240 --> 11:08.360
Was I smiling?

131
11:08.810 --> 11:09.240
Scissors.

132
11:13.600 --> 11:14.810
Ever since you went out,

133
11:14.970 --> 11:16.290
you've been grinning to yourself.

134
11:17.930 --> 11:19.090
Did something good happen?

135
11:19.840 --> 11:20.760
Did you see your sweetheart?

136
11:22.210 --> 11:23.240
What sweetheart?

137
11:23.720 --> 11:24.480
I don't have one!

138
11:26.330 --> 11:27.360
What do you like about Yan Shang?

139
11:28.640 --> 11:29.170
No!

140
11:29.480 --> 11:30.520
I was thinking about Liu Wenji.

141
11:32.330 --> 11:33.520
Then what do you like about Liu Wenji?

142
11:36.640 --> 11:38.240
I'm not even sure if it's love.

143
11:38.810 --> 11:41.640
I suppose love means always wanting to see someone

144
11:42.330 --> 11:44.000
and never wanting to leave when you're together.

145
11:46.810 --> 11:48.170
How did you know exactly what I was thinking?

146
11:49.600 --> 11:50.360
You like him.

147
11:51.640 --> 11:53.520
But does he like you?

148
11:56.120 --> 11:56.600
I don't know.

149
11:57.330 --> 11:58.170
But I could ask him.

150
11:58.450 --> 11:58.880
Ask him?

151
11:59.360 --> 12:00.210
How would you do that?

152
12:01.970 --> 12:03.840
Liu Wenji invited me to the Peony Festival.

153
12:04.210 --> 12:05.290
I could ask him then.

154
12:06.810 --> 12:07.290
But

155
12:07.970 --> 12:09.360
I haven't asked for your permission yet.

156
12:10.360 --> 12:11.930
If you say no, I won't go.

157
12:13.480 --> 12:14.360
Go if you want to.

158
12:14.970 --> 12:16.690
I won't be the villain who keeps two lovers apart.

159
12:17.880 --> 12:18.600
But

160
12:19.640 --> 12:20.360
you should know

161
12:21.000 --> 12:23.090
life is already hard enough for women.

162
12:24.050 --> 12:25.970
Don't give your heart away too easily.

163
12:32.570 --> 12:33.720
Your Highness, you're teasing me.

164
12:35.840 --> 12:36.840
If the day ever comes

165
12:37.410 --> 12:38.720
when my dear Chunhua gets married,

166
12:39.290 --> 12:42.090
I'll give you the grandest wedding send-off.

167
12:43.210 --> 12:44.640
Every young woman in Sheng'an

168
12:45.240 --> 12:45.970
will envy you.

169
12:50.760 --> 12:51.050
No!

170
12:52.000 --> 12:52.480
I won't marry.

171
12:53.810 --> 12:54.840
I want to stay with you forever, Your Highness.

172
12:55.600 --> 12:56.600
Don't be silly.

173
12:57.240 --> 12:57.930
How sappy!

174
13:04.570 --> 13:06.210
Your Highness, why have you embroidered so many fish?

175
13:07.360 --> 13:08.120
What bad luck!

176
13:11.640 --> 13:12.810
This year's imperial exams

177
13:13.170 --> 13:14.120
are fast approaching.

178
13:14.840 --> 13:16.810
You must focus entirely on your studies.

179
13:17.690 --> 13:18.410
Class dismissed.

180
13:21.520 --> 13:22.930
Thank you, sir.

181
13:23.940 --> 13:29.180
(Upright Heart, Sincere Intent)

182
13:40.930 --> 13:41.330
Yan Shang.

183
13:44.360 --> 13:44.810
Yan Shang?

184
13:49.240 --> 13:50.720
What's got you so lost in thought?

185
13:53.210 --> 13:55.000
I've been thinking about an unfinished game of Go.

186
13:55.880 --> 13:56.880
The imperial exams are almost here,

187
13:57.690 --> 13:58.880
and you still have time to think about Go?

188
14:00.240 --> 14:02.050
This morning, at Sigui Garden in Jinchang Ward,

189
14:02.330 --> 14:03.240
I happened to meet an elderly gentleman.

190
14:03.840 --> 14:04.840
We played a game of Go.

191
14:05.600 --> 14:07.000
Later, I heard someone call him

192
14:07.640 --> 14:08.210
Chancellor Liu.

193
14:08.640 --> 14:09.360
Chancellor Liu?

194
14:11.570 --> 14:12.690
What was he doing at Sigui Garden?

195
14:16.810 --> 14:18.410
Well, there's something you two don't know.

196
14:22.810 --> 14:23.600
Sigui Garden

197
14:24.210 --> 14:26.000
was once the residence of the late Chancellor Ma.

198
14:26.840 --> 14:28.720
Scholars often held literary gatherings there.

199
14:28.880 --> 14:31.760
I hear Chancellor Liu often attended them in his youth,

200
14:31.970 --> 14:33.170
reciting poetry and discussing philosophy.

201
14:34.170 --> 14:35.330
But nowadays,

202
14:35.760 --> 14:37.480
the garden has changed hands several times.

203
14:37.720 --> 14:38.570
The place remains, but the people are gone.

204
14:39.930 --> 14:40.640
Perhaps

205
14:41.360 --> 14:42.720
Chancellor Liu was feeling nostalgic.

206
14:44.810 --> 14:45.240
Yan Shang.

207
14:46.240 --> 14:47.290
You really are lucky.

208
14:47.810 --> 14:49.360
You met someone so influential just by taking a stroll.

209
14:51.000 --> 14:51.690
I see.

210
14:53.050 --> 14:53.360
Oh, by the way,

211
14:54.840 --> 14:56.970
there's a rare black peony in Sigui Garden.

212
14:57.410 --> 14:58.720
Every year during the Peony Festival,

213
14:59.000 --> 15:01.090
people from all over the capital flock there.

214
15:01.480 --> 15:02.600
After the Rebellion of the Seven Garrisons,

215
15:02.840 --> 15:05.050
nearly all the capital's famous temples and gardens were destroyed.

216
15:05.330 --> 15:08.450
But the black peony at Sigui Garden miraculously survived.

217
15:09.000 --> 15:10.840
That's why the festival has grown so popular.

218
15:11.240 --> 15:12.570
Nobles gather there every year.

219
15:12.880 --> 15:13.520
Even...

220
15:19.050 --> 15:21.120
Even Grand Princess Luling

221
15:21.480 --> 15:22.760
attends in person every year.

222
15:23.570 --> 15:24.000
I hear

223
15:24.360 --> 15:27.290
she even has her own private pavilion in the garden.

224
15:27.880 --> 15:29.640
Someone like Grand Princess Luling

225
15:30.090 --> 15:30.880
also enjoys flowers too?

226
15:31.640 --> 15:32.330
Wei Shu,

227
15:32.690 --> 15:34.050
she's certainly not there for the flowers.

228
15:34.810 --> 15:36.210
Haven't you two heard?

229
15:39.810 --> 15:40.930
The Grand Princess

230
15:41.360 --> 15:42.930
often uses festivals as an excuse

231
15:43.290 --> 15:44.290
to choose new male favorites

232
15:45.360 --> 15:46.450
and have secret rendezvous.

233
15:49.090 --> 15:50.240
She's a Grand Princess.

234
15:51.050 --> 15:52.290
Doing such things in secret,

235
15:53.090 --> 15:54.450
isn't she afraid of putting herself in danger?

236
15:55.000 --> 15:56.640
She takes guards everywhere she goes.

237
15:57.170 --> 15:59.000
She's surrounded by attendants inside and out.

238
15:59.600 --> 16:00.170
Besides,

239
16:00.410 --> 16:01.480
who in Sheng'an

240
16:01.970 --> 16:03.240
would dare lay a finger on her?

241
16:04.760 --> 16:06.170
Last year, some fool

242
16:06.570 --> 16:07.699
barged into her private pavilion

243
16:07.741 --> 16:08.711
to present his writings to her.

244
16:09.290 --> 16:11.360
Unfortunately, he was hideously ugly.

245
16:11.450 --> 16:12.290
A real eyesore.

246
16:12.640 --> 16:14.410
The Grand Princess was furious.

247
16:14.640 --> 16:16.120
She immediately had her guards drag him out

248
16:16.360 --> 16:17.290
and beat him to death.

249
16:18.760 --> 16:20.210
A man's life was taken just like that,

250
16:20.840 --> 16:21.880
and no one dared question it.

251
16:23.520 --> 16:24.840
At this year's festival,

252
16:25.120 --> 16:26.429
I wonder how many

253
16:26.471 --> 16:28.469
handsome young men she'll choose

254
16:28.511 --> 16:29.671
to become her male favorites.

255
16:30.120 --> 16:30.570
Feng Xianyu,

256
16:30.970 --> 16:32.360
how did it go with your writings yesterday?

257
16:34.720 --> 16:35.240
I...

258
16:35.760 --> 16:36.840
Yesterday, I...

259
16:37.360 --> 16:37.840
Mr. Zhao.

260
16:39.720 --> 16:40.810
Writings, Writings!

261
16:41.170 --> 16:42.840
At least you have decent writing to show.

262
16:43.090 --> 16:43.570
But me?

263
16:43.930 --> 16:45.360
My essays are complete rubbish!

264
16:45.570 --> 16:47.290
My father would break my legs if he had to read another one!

265
16:48.930 --> 16:50.120
You're being too modest, Zhao.

266
16:50.570 --> 16:51.480
(Zhao, Student at the Imperial Academy) Just look at me!

267
16:51.970 --> 16:52.480
Do I

268
16:52.880 --> 16:53.930
look like I'm being modest?

269
16:55.480 --> 16:56.640
If my father hadn't forced me,

270
16:56.970 --> 16:58.840
(Upright Heart, Sincere Intent) I'd never have set foot in this academy!

271
16:59.520 --> 17:00.840
He gained admission through family privilege

272
17:01.570 --> 17:02.600
and had his elders looking out for him.

273
17:04.130 --> 17:05.610
What more could he ask for?

274
17:08.650 --> 17:09.890
(Peony Festival...)

275
17:10.690 --> 17:12.280
(The Grand Princess attends every year...)

276
17:13.320 --> 17:14.210
(Private Pavilion...)

277
17:19.040 --> 17:19.410
Mr. Zhao!

278
17:20.800 --> 17:21.240
(Upright Heart, Sincere Intent) Mr. Zhao!

279
17:22.850 --> 17:23.800
Mr. Zhao, wait!

280
17:24.720 --> 17:25.080
What is it?

281
17:26.000 --> 17:27.280
Could we speak in private?

282
17:33.040 --> 17:33.320
Come on.

283
17:36.130 --> 17:36.890
What do you want?

284
17:37.130 --> 17:38.170
Why all the secrecy?

285
17:39.520 --> 17:40.760
A man of your standing, Mr. Zhao,

286
17:41.210 --> 17:43.240
shouldn't have to worry about a few essays.

287
17:45.210 --> 17:45.720
Unlike me.

288
17:46.450 --> 17:47.410
Apart from writing,

289
17:47.610 --> 17:48.610
I have nothing to offer.

290
17:49.560 --> 17:50.480
If you're interested, Mr. Zhao,

291
17:53.320 --> 17:55.000
I could provide you with a few essays

292
17:55.610 --> 17:56.760
to present to potential patrons.

293
17:58.170 --> 17:59.170
You'd do that for me?

294
18:02.930 --> 18:04.480
You're not giving them away for free, are you?

295
18:07.040 --> 18:08.480
Nothing gets past you, Mr. Zhao.

296
18:09.000 --> 18:10.210
I've been rather

297
18:10.970 --> 18:11.760
short on money lately.

298
18:12.320 --> 18:13.410
As for the cost of writing materials,

299
18:13.930 --> 18:14.690
I wonder if you'd be willing

300
18:15.410 --> 18:16.320
to cover my expenses?

301
18:18.970 --> 18:19.800
Then we have a deal!

302
18:22.480 --> 18:23.210
Well... Didn't see that coming.

303
18:23.850 --> 18:25.320
Our teacher's always praising your talent.

304
18:25.760 --> 18:27.450
Who knew you'd be practical enough to do something like this?

305
18:28.890 --> 18:29.720
Even a gentleman needs money.

306
18:30.130 --> 18:31.080
Nothing to be ashamed of.

307
18:33.280 --> 18:33.650
So tell me,

308
18:34.520 --> 18:34.930
how much?

309
18:40.760 --> 18:41.560
That much?

310
18:41.970 --> 18:43.170
I could buy myself a top courtesan for that!

311
18:44.850 --> 18:46.480
It might be expensive for others,

312
18:47.000 --> 18:48.000
but for someone like you,

313
18:48.520 --> 18:49.800
it's just the cost of a few banquets.

314
18:55.320 --> 18:55.720
Fine.

315
18:56.240 --> 18:56.800
I'll pay.

316
18:57.690 --> 18:58.480
But let's get one thing straight.

317
18:59.000 --> 19:00.280
Those essays had better be good!

318
19:00.520 --> 19:01.080
And write plenty of them!

319
19:01.280 --> 19:02.000
Rest assured, Mr. Zhao.

320
19:03.080 --> 19:03.520
Thank you.

321
19:04.130 --> 19:04.520
I'll be off.

322
19:07.040 --> 19:07.610
It's a deal.

323
19:10.620 --> 19:15.460
(Two Days Before the Peony Festival)

324
19:15.930 --> 19:16.240
Sir.

325
19:17.760 --> 19:18.210
Young man.

326
19:18.850 --> 19:19.480
(Sigui Garden) We meet again.

327
19:20.320 --> 19:21.240
You certainly are eager.

328
19:21.610 --> 19:23.650
The black peony won't bloom for another two days.

329
19:24.930 --> 19:26.210
I have nothing else to do,

330
19:26.720 --> 19:28.320
so I thought I'd enjoy the garden while it's quiet.

331
19:30.130 --> 19:30.410
By the way,

332
19:31.080 --> 19:31.760
I've heard

333
19:31.850 --> 19:34.040
Grand Princess Luling has a private pavilion in the garden.

334
19:34.320 --> 19:35.800
Which one is it?

335
19:36.240 --> 19:37.930
Whenever the Grand Princess comes to see the flowers,

336
19:38.040 --> 19:39.720
she takes over Jifang Pavilion.

337
19:44.410 --> 19:45.040
To tell you the truth, sir,

338
19:45.610 --> 19:47.240
I haven't found anyone willing to back me lately.

339
19:47.690 --> 19:48.690
When the Grand Princess arrives,

340
19:49.280 --> 19:50.170
might I request an audience?

341
19:51.000 --> 19:51.370
Sir,

342
19:51.800 --> 19:52.520
you mustn't.

343
19:53.000 --> 19:55.450
The Grand Princess forbids anyone from disturbing her during her visits.

344
19:55.760 --> 19:57.520
Last year, a young man knocked on her door seeking an audience.

345
19:57.800 --> 19:58.800
She wouldn't even open the door.

346
19:58.890 --> 20:01.130
Her guards came out and beat him half to death!

347
20:05.000 --> 20:06.040
Thank you for the warning, sir.

348
20:22.170 --> 20:22.560
Wenji.

349
20:24.450 --> 20:24.850
Wenji.

350
20:27.690 --> 20:28.240
You're back.

351
20:30.370 --> 20:32.320
An old servant just delivered a chest.

352
20:33.000 --> 20:33.850
He said

353
20:34.280 --> 20:36.520
his master was surnamed... Zhao.

354
20:47.650 --> 20:47.970
Shang.

355
20:48.970 --> 20:49.760
These money...

356
20:51.560 --> 20:53.080
I wrote some essays for him.

357
20:53.170 --> 20:54.720
This is my payment.

358
20:56.720 --> 20:57.000
You...

359
20:58.800 --> 20:59.690
Are you short on money?

360
21:00.370 --> 21:01.370
Why didn't you tell me?

361
21:01.480 --> 21:02.320
I could've lent you some!

362
21:05.000 --> 21:06.520
We're friends. There's no need to talk about loans.

363
21:07.480 --> 21:08.040
I'm not short of money.

364
21:08.320 --> 21:08.890
I just need more of it.

365
21:09.370 --> 21:10.170
Living in the capital is expensive.

366
21:10.610 --> 21:11.760
You should save your money too.

367
21:15.560 --> 21:16.930
If I'm not mistaken,

368
21:17.970 --> 21:19.650
you had a lovestruck look on your face just now.

369
21:22.850 --> 21:23.720
I asked Chunhua

370
21:24.650 --> 21:26.970
to go to the Peony Festival with me in two days.

371
21:28.850 --> 21:31.040
So you've got two happy occasions coming up!

372
21:32.970 --> 21:33.690
Congratulations!

373
21:35.040 --> 21:35.890
What two occasions?

374
21:37.800 --> 21:38.690
Passing the imperial exams

375
21:39.040 --> 21:39.890
and getting married.

376
21:40.320 --> 21:41.480
What could be better than that?

377
21:45.970 --> 21:46.370
Shang.

378
21:47.080 --> 21:48.170
As for the imperial exams,

379
21:48.610 --> 21:50.410
I can study hard and earn my success.

380
21:51.170 --> 21:52.240
But marriage is another matter.

381
21:59.890 --> 22:01.240
Even if I truly wanted to marry her,

382
22:01.800 --> 22:02.280
I'm afraid

383
22:02.800 --> 22:04.040
my father would never approve.

384
22:05.080 --> 22:05.690
After all,

385
22:07.000 --> 22:08.040
she's only a...

386
22:09.320 --> 22:09.650
She's...

387
22:14.850 --> 22:15.970
Whether you two end up together

388
22:16.650 --> 22:18.130
ultimately depends on what you want.

389
22:32.930 --> 22:34.170
It's too early to talk about that.

390
22:36.760 --> 22:37.690
I need to go out.

391
22:38.170 --> 22:39.370
Don't wait for me for dinner.

392
22:41.370 --> 22:41.760
Shang.

393
22:42.610 --> 22:43.450
Where are you going?

394
22:44.930 --> 22:47.210
To see what it's like to spend a fortune.

395
22:54.170 --> 22:54.890
This money

396
22:55.480 --> 22:56.480
should be enough to buy your freedom.

397
23:03.040 --> 23:04.040
I can't accept something for nothing.

398
23:05.170 --> 23:06.560
Please tell me what you want.

399
23:08.480 --> 23:08.890
It's nothing difficult.

400
23:09.760 --> 23:10.560
All I need is for you

401
23:11.040 --> 23:12.410
to do me one small favor.

402
23:16.410 --> 23:19.690
(Sharpening scissors! Kitchen knives for sale!)

403
23:20.560 --> 23:22.189
(Get your scissors sharpened!)

404
23:22.231 --> 23:25.469
(Come take a look! Beautiful patterned cloth!)

405
23:25.511 --> 23:25.881
Sir.

406
23:26.450 --> 23:27.610
Need your scissors sharpened? Or want a kitchen knife?

407
23:33.720 --> 23:34.130
Sir,

408
23:34.850 --> 23:35.970
how much is this little knife?

409
23:36.450 --> 23:37.040
This one?

410
23:37.410 --> 23:37.970
Fifty.

411
23:41.280 --> 23:41.800
Young man,

412
23:42.170 --> 23:43.040
take a look at this one.

413
23:44.320 --> 23:45.280
Fine craftsmanship, quality steel.

414
23:45.690 --> 23:46.720
Only three hundred.

415
23:50.610 --> 23:51.040
No, thank you.

416
23:52.610 --> 23:53.130
Sir.

417
23:53.610 --> 23:54.800
I'll be straight with you.

418
23:55.690 --> 23:57.210
This knife may be cheap,

419
23:57.520 --> 23:58.720
but after just a few uses,

420
23:59.610 --> 24:00.760
the blade will probably go dull.

421
24:01.520 --> 24:02.130
When it comes to knives,

422
24:02.320 --> 24:03.450
it's worth paying more.

423
24:03.760 --> 24:04.610
It may cost a little extra,

424
24:04.890 --> 24:06.130
but it'll last you for years.

425
24:06.280 --> 24:06.930
Thank you, sir.

426
24:07.520 --> 24:08.210
Once will be enough.

427
24:09.080 --> 24:10.040
All right. Thank you!

428
24:11.930 --> 24:12.690
Take care.

429
24:15.210 --> 24:17.130
(Get your scissors sharpened!)

430
25:12.450 --> 25:13.320
Captain! It's me! It's me!

431
25:13.520 --> 25:13.970
It's me!

432
25:17.210 --> 25:18.560
So you're already awake, Captain.

433
25:19.280 --> 25:20.210
I was just wondering

434
25:20.410 --> 25:22.240
how hard I'd have to slap you to wake you up.

435
25:24.370 --> 25:26.800
I've crawled out of piles of corpses.

436
25:27.610 --> 25:29.189
I never sleep that deeply.

437
25:29.231 --> 25:30.301
You think I need you to slap me awake?

438
25:31.000 --> 25:31.410
Of course.

439
25:31.800 --> 25:32.690
What is it? Spit it out!

440
25:49.240 --> 25:50.389
Well, well!

441
25:50.431 --> 25:51.711
Her personal handkerchief.

442
25:52.850 --> 25:53.520
Smells lovely!

443
25:54.930 --> 25:56.800
Congratulations, Captain. You've gotten your wish.

444
25:57.130 --> 26:00.650
That little minx actually said yes?

445
26:00.850 --> 26:01.520
Rest assured, Captain.

446
26:02.170 --> 26:04.930
Xu Mianmian simply didn't appreciate your sincere feelings before.

447
26:05.520 --> 26:06.690
Once I explained everything,

448
26:07.040 --> 26:08.080
she was filled with regret.

449
26:08.930 --> 26:10.560
That's why she asked me to deliver this embroidered handkerchief

450
26:11.040 --> 26:12.130
as a token of her affection.

451
26:15.280 --> 26:17.170
At least she knows what's good for her!

452
26:17.480 --> 26:19.280
Xu Mianmian also asked me to tell you

453
26:19.800 --> 26:22.480
that she'd like to meet you at Sigui Garden in Jinchang Ward

454
26:22.930 --> 26:24.210
to satisfy her longing for you.

455
26:32.930 --> 26:33.760
But...

456
26:35.650 --> 26:37.560
if that little minx wants to be with me,

457
26:38.890 --> 26:40.480
why meet in a garden?

458
26:41.520 --> 26:42.610
There's something you should know, Captain.

459
26:43.320 --> 26:44.720
In two days, Sigui Garden

460
26:45.320 --> 26:46.650
will host the Peony Festival.

461
26:47.040 --> 26:48.320
It's quite a spectacular event.

462
26:49.040 --> 26:52.210
The garden has secluded pavilions hidden among the flowers and trees.

463
26:53.040 --> 26:54.130
A secret rendezvous there...

464
26:54.850 --> 26:55.370
Wouldn't that

465
26:56.410 --> 26:57.760
add a little excitement?

466
27:01.650 --> 27:03.800
You're getting me all worked up!

467
27:05.370 --> 27:06.690
You sly devil!

468
27:07.720 --> 27:09.720
You scholars have all sorts of tricks.

469
27:10.240 --> 27:10.890
You know how to have fun.

470
27:12.000 --> 27:12.320
Good.

471
27:13.760 --> 27:14.080
Good.

472
27:14.760 --> 27:15.970
You've done a fine job!

473
27:16.720 --> 27:18.720
From now on, your recommendations,

474
27:19.080 --> 27:19.800
your official career...

475
27:21.410 --> 27:21.890
Leave it all to me!

476
27:24.520 --> 27:26.720
It's my honor to be of service, Captain.

477
27:28.320 --> 27:28.690
Good!

478
29:16.420 --> 29:18.500
(One Day Before the Peony Festival) (Bright Virtue)

479
29:18.560 --> 29:19.410
(Virtuous and Learned) (You go ahead to the dining hall.)

480
29:19.760 --> 29:20.560
(I'm going back to my dormitory.)

481
29:20.800 --> 29:21.210
(All right.)

482
29:22.040 --> 29:22.429
(See you tomorrow.)

483
29:22.471 --> 29:23.119
(Thank you for your hard work, sir.)

484
29:23.161 --> 29:23.441
(All right.)

485
29:24.610 --> 29:25.080
(Let's go.)

486
29:26.080 --> 29:26.610
(Hurry to the dining hall.)

487
29:27.890 --> 29:28.240
(Wait for me.)

488
29:30.610 --> 29:31.040
Sir.

489
29:33.040 --> 29:34.800
I'd like to request a day off tomorrow.

490
29:36.690 --> 29:37.410
What for?

491
29:39.080 --> 29:40.040
I've heard

492
29:40.370 --> 29:42.450
there's a Peony Festival in Jinchang Ward tomorrow.

493
29:42.930 --> 29:43.890
It's one of Sheng'an's grandest events.

494
29:44.560 --> 29:45.690
I'd really love to see it.

495
29:46.130 --> 29:46.970
I was hoping...

496
29:48.930 --> 29:49.480
I'd say

497
29:50.080 --> 29:51.450
you're not really interested in the flowers.

498
29:52.970 --> 29:54.610
You're hoping to find a powerful supporter, aren't you?

499
30:00.210 --> 30:00.560
Fair enough.

500
30:01.410 --> 30:02.720
The annual Peony Festival is a fine opportunity

501
30:03.280 --> 30:05.560
for scholars like you to win the influential officials' favor.

502
30:05.970 --> 30:06.280
Very well.

503
30:07.130 --> 30:07.480
You may go.

504
30:08.480 --> 30:09.210
Thank you, sir.

505
30:22.450 --> 30:23.450
When you left,

506
30:23.690 --> 30:25.080
the prince and I had just gotten married.

507
30:25.890 --> 30:27.210
Now three years have passed,

508
30:27.760 --> 30:29.650
(Liang Lingyi, Princess Consort of Jin) and I still haven't borne him a child.

509
30:31.410 --> 30:32.040
Wanyao,

510
30:32.650 --> 30:33.850
of everyone in Sheng'an,

511
30:34.410 --> 30:35.410
I think you're the only one

512
30:35.930 --> 30:37.320
who truly understands my suffering.

513
30:39.080 --> 30:39.800
I don't understand.

514
30:41.890 --> 30:42.170
But...

515
30:43.240 --> 30:45.370
You were married for three years without having children too.

516
30:57.210 --> 30:59.760
I've never intended to bear children for anyone.

517
31:01.480 --> 31:02.370
I'm afraid you've misunderstood me.

518
31:04.690 --> 31:06.410
Even if your husband is gone,

519
31:06.480 --> 31:07.800
you shouldn't say things like that.

520
31:08.320 --> 31:09.720
You're a princess of the Huai Dynasty.

521
31:10.370 --> 31:11.280
Remarrying would be easy for you.

522
31:12.520 --> 31:13.720
Besides, you're still young.

523
31:14.240 --> 31:16.280
Don't worry. You can still have children.

524
31:20.610 --> 31:21.760
Then let's hope you're right.

525
31:25.320 --> 31:26.240
Have you heard?

526
31:26.890 --> 31:29.000
The Peony Goddess at Sigui Garden

527
31:29.210 --> 31:31.080
is said to grant prayers for children.

528
31:32.850 --> 31:33.320
Cailian.

529
31:34.080 --> 31:34.650
Put these away.

530
31:35.520 --> 31:35.890
Yes, Your Highness.

531
31:41.370 --> 31:43.000
The Peony Festival is tomorrow.

532
31:43.720 --> 31:44.800
Why not come with me?

533
31:45.210 --> 31:46.080
I'll pray for a child,

534
31:46.450 --> 31:48.080
and you can draw a fortune for love.

535
31:49.210 --> 31:50.210
Thank you for the kind invitation.

536
31:50.850 --> 31:53.130
The festival will be crowded.

537
31:54.210 --> 31:54.930
I'm not used to crowds.

538
32:05.760 --> 32:06.210
All right, then.

539
32:07.040 --> 32:08.320
You should think carefully

540
32:08.720 --> 32:10.560
about what a woman's life is really for.

541
32:11.130 --> 32:12.450
If you change your mind,

542
32:12.760 --> 32:13.760
send someone to the Prince of Jin's residence

543
32:14.210 --> 32:15.240
to let me know.

544
32:15.690 --> 32:16.000
All right.

545
32:17.650 --> 32:18.450
Let me see you out.

546
32:18.850 --> 32:19.450
No need.

547
32:30.720 --> 32:32.040
Your Highness, Yang Si is here.

548
32:32.850 --> 32:33.800
What does he want this time?

549
32:38.170 --> 32:39.040
Did I say you could come in?

550
32:41.000 --> 32:41.760
How did you get in here?

551
32:41.930 --> 32:43.520
Well, nobody told me I couldn't.

552
32:43.970 --> 32:45.280
I know this residence like the back of my hand.

553
32:45.650 --> 32:47.040
I could find my way to you with my eyes closed.

554
32:48.480 --> 32:49.650
Well? What do you want?

555
32:51.080 --> 32:54.450
The Peony Festival at Sigui Garden in Jinchang Ward is tomorrow.

556
32:56.370 --> 32:57.560
I... I'll take you.

557
32:58.040 --> 32:58.450
Not interested.

558
32:59.410 --> 33:00.210
Why not?

559
33:00.800 --> 33:02.170
If you're not going with me, who else would you go with?

560
33:02.410 --> 33:03.410
That man named Wei Shu?

561
33:05.170 --> 33:05.930
You're too late.

562
33:07.040 --> 33:08.450
I'm going with the Princess Consort of Jin.

563
33:10.210 --> 33:11.560
What are you going with her for?

564
33:12.240 --> 33:13.080
To pray for a child.

565
33:44.080 --> 33:45.280
(Besides, you're still young.)

566
33:45.800 --> 33:46.450
(Don't worry.)

567
33:46.970 --> 33:48.040
(You can still have children.)

568
33:57.450 --> 33:57.760
Shang.

569
33:58.320 --> 33:58.850
How's my ironing?

570
33:59.320 --> 33:59.760
Is it smooth enough?

571
34:01.450 --> 34:01.850
Looks good.

572
34:03.080 --> 34:03.720
You're not even looking.

573
34:08.600 --> 34:08.970
Wenji.

574
34:10.410 --> 34:11.080
Get some rest.

575
34:11.600 --> 34:12.290
I'm going for a walk.

576
34:13.850 --> 34:14.410
At this hour?

577
34:14.890 --> 34:15.480
Aren't you going to bed?

578
34:15.770 --> 34:16.330
I can't sleep.

579
34:32.460 --> 34:36.900
(Auspicious Blessings Fill the Streets)

580
34:39.800 --> 34:43.560
(Fragrances Shop)

581
35:04.120 --> 35:04.520
Your Highness.

582
35:04.890 --> 35:05.560
It's time to rest.

583
35:09.640 --> 35:10.250
I can't sleep.

584
35:10.850 --> 35:11.480
You go get some rest.

585
35:13.160 --> 35:14.080
I'd like to stay up a little longer.

586
35:21.520 --> 35:22.200
If you don't leave,

587
35:22.930 --> 35:24.040
you'll have to drink with me.

588
35:27.850 --> 35:28.330
Your Highness,

589
35:29.640 --> 35:31.040
that day Shang came to the residence,

590
35:32.480 --> 35:33.480
I was the one who invited him.

591
35:34.080 --> 35:35.000
Why did you invite him?

592
35:36.040 --> 35:37.040
Were you trying to drive Yang Si mad?

593
35:37.970 --> 35:40.080
How was I supposed to know he'd run into Yang Si?

594
35:40.560 --> 35:41.890
You've had trouble sleeping for years.

595
35:42.600 --> 35:44.250
The only time you slept well was in Lingnan.

596
35:45.290 --> 35:45.850
So I thought

597
35:46.250 --> 35:47.770
perhaps it was because Shang was with you.

598
35:48.250 --> 35:49.370
He's always been good with words.

599
35:50.600 --> 35:52.520
I thought if I invited Shang over

600
35:52.930 --> 35:54.640
to keep you company like he did in Lingnan,

601
35:54.930 --> 35:56.000
perhaps you'd sleep better.

602
35:56.770 --> 35:57.770
You silly girl.

603
35:58.450 --> 35:59.890
Where do you get these ideas?

604
36:13.620 --> 36:15.900
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

605
36:17.940 --> 36:20.060
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

606
36:26.250 --> 36:27.250
What's he doing here?

607
36:29.970 --> 36:30.890
Yan Shang.

608
36:32.680 --> 36:33.450
I'll go bring him in.

609
36:51.250 --> 36:51.640
Your Highness.

610
36:59.000 --> 37:00.410
In the middle of the night,

611
37:00.850 --> 37:02.410
lurking outside my residence...

612
37:03.640 --> 37:04.890
What mischief are you up to?

613
37:06.930 --> 37:07.730
I couldn't sleep tonight.

614
37:08.520 --> 37:09.970
So I decided to take a walk.

615
37:10.810 --> 37:12.600
I must've wandered farther than I intended.

616
37:14.680 --> 37:15.520
So,

617
37:16.080 --> 37:17.160
you just happened

618
37:17.850 --> 37:18.810
to end up here?

619
37:20.250 --> 37:20.730
I suppose so.

620
37:22.250 --> 37:23.330
And why did you invite me inside,

621
37:24.770 --> 37:25.730
Your Highness?

622
37:32.330 --> 37:33.160
It's a long, dull night.

623
37:33.930 --> 37:34.970
I summoned you to tell me a story.

624
38:00.850 --> 38:02.160
What kind of story would you like to hear, Your Highness?

625
38:04.640 --> 38:06.810
I thought you'd ask me why,

626
38:07.890 --> 38:09.040
or fly into a rage

627
38:09.680 --> 38:10.600
and storm off.

628
38:22.120 --> 38:22.560
Your Highness,

629
38:24.770 --> 38:25.600
it's cold at this hour.

630
38:27.000 --> 38:28.080
Drinking could harm your health.

631
38:35.000 --> 38:36.040
Why are your hands so cold?

632
38:37.810 --> 38:38.730
Can't you afford warm clothes?

633
38:41.330 --> 38:42.080
I was in such a hurry to get here,

634
38:42.930 --> 38:43.930
I forgot to put on a cloak.

635
38:46.770 --> 38:47.850
Don't try to make me pity you.

636
38:48.640 --> 38:49.930
If your story is good,

637
38:51.200 --> 38:52.250
I'll give you that cloak

638
38:52.810 --> 38:53.890
as a reward.

639
38:56.450 --> 38:58.730
You certainly have plenty of cloaks, Your Highness.

640
39:08.450 --> 39:09.160
Go on.

641
39:09.810 --> 39:10.520
Tell me

642
39:11.080 --> 39:11.930
whatever you wish.

643
39:20.120 --> 39:21.600
Then I'll tell Your Highness

644
39:22.520 --> 39:24.120
a story about a venomous snake and a hornet.

645
39:28.890 --> 39:29.560
Once upon a time,

646
39:30.160 --> 39:31.160
there was a venomous snake.

647
39:32.000 --> 39:32.890
It was being chased by humans.

648
39:33.930 --> 39:35.370
At its most vulnerable moment,

649
39:36.080 --> 39:37.330
it encountered a hornet.

650
39:38.250 --> 39:39.850
One crawled on the ground,

651
39:40.080 --> 39:41.080
while the other flew through the air.

652
39:42.200 --> 39:43.520
Their paths should never have crossed.

653
39:44.410 --> 39:44.930
But unexpectedly,

654
39:46.080 --> 39:47.410
the hornet suddenly swooped down

655
39:47.890 --> 39:50.160
and stung the snake viciously on the head.

656
39:51.810 --> 39:53.120
Did the snake die from the sting?

657
39:55.040 --> 39:55.410
No.

658
39:56.890 --> 39:58.120
Its fate was far worse.

659
39:59.370 --> 40:02.040
The hornet's venom remained inside the snake's head.

660
40:02.930 --> 40:04.600
Day after day, year after year,

661
40:05.520 --> 40:07.640
it suffered constant, burning agony.

662
40:09.410 --> 40:09.890
And so,

663
40:11.080 --> 40:12.480
the pain lasted ten whole years.

664
40:14.160 --> 40:15.120
Unable to bear the pain,

665
40:16.200 --> 40:17.970
the snake searched everywhere for the hornet.

666
40:18.810 --> 40:20.000
It searched for many years.

667
40:21.680 --> 40:23.200
But one crawled on the ground,

668
40:23.930 --> 40:25.000
while the other flew through the air.

669
40:25.890 --> 40:27.040
How could it ever find the hornet?

670
40:28.640 --> 40:29.120
And yet,

671
40:30.040 --> 40:30.930
fate had other plans.

672
40:31.560 --> 40:32.579
One day, the snake

673
40:32.621 --> 40:33.831
crossed paths with that same hornet.

674
40:34.640 --> 40:36.520
The very one that had stung its head.

675
40:38.330 --> 40:40.200
The snake invited the hornet to travel with it.

676
40:41.330 --> 40:41.770
Sure enough,

677
40:42.520 --> 40:43.810
the hornet hadn't changed its ways

678
40:44.330 --> 40:45.200
and tried to sting the snake again.

679
40:46.410 --> 40:48.560
But this time, the snake didn't flee.

680
40:48.970 --> 40:50.850
Instead, it willingly offered up its head.

681
40:55.000 --> 40:57.810
Just as the hornet plunged its stinger into the snake's head,

682
40:59.560 --> 41:00.450
the snake thrust its head

683
41:01.480 --> 41:03.250
beneath the wheel of a passing carriage.

684
41:05.370 --> 41:07.000
The snake's head and the hornet

685
41:08.250 --> 41:09.450
were crushed beneath the wheel.

686
41:11.600 --> 41:12.810
They were both dead.

687
41:15.120 --> 41:16.250
That was a terrible story.

688
41:17.520 --> 41:18.450
You're not getting that cloak.

689
41:19.160 --> 41:19.850
What was wrong with it?

690
41:24.040 --> 41:25.160
Even if the snake killed the hornet,

691
41:25.850 --> 41:27.000
it wouldn't cure the pain in its head.

692
41:28.160 --> 41:30.040
Such revenge would accomplish nothing.

693
41:30.890 --> 41:31.480
And worse still,

694
41:32.120 --> 41:33.080
they both ended up dead.

695
41:35.250 --> 41:36.680
There are countless ways to kill a hornet

696
41:37.250 --> 41:38.200
and take revenge.

697
41:39.000 --> 41:40.770
Why sacrifice its own life to do it?

698
41:42.250 --> 41:43.160
Don't tell me

699
41:43.890 --> 41:44.640
such foolish stories again.

700
41:46.520 --> 41:47.730
You're absolutely right, Your Highness.

701
41:53.520 --> 41:54.600
(But if one day,)

702
41:55.330 --> 41:57.080
(I get the chance to kill my enemy with my own hands,)

703
41:58.250 --> 42:00.290
(what does it matter if it's foolish?)

704
43:02.480 --> 43:02.970
Your Highness.

705
43:06.770 --> 43:07.410
I must leave.

706
44:03.500 --> 44:07.740
(Next Episode Preview)

707
44:09.450 --> 44:10.890
Seal off the entire garden!

708
44:11.000 --> 44:12.250
Until that filthy wretch is caught,

709
44:12.560 --> 44:13.600
no one is leaving!

710
44:14.080 --> 44:15.450
There's been a murder in the garden.

711
44:15.560 --> 44:18.000
Aunt! I heard someone was killed in the garden!

712
44:18.330 --> 44:20.200
Aunt, I really can't stand the sight of blood!

713
44:20.480 --> 44:21.520
Let her go! Let her go!

714
44:21.850 --> 44:22.520
You're the best!

715
44:24.481 --> 44:27.774
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

716
44:30.459 --> 44:35.375
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

717
44:37.569 --> 44:43.414
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

718
44:43.914 --> 44:49.140
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

719
44:51.909 --> 44:56.700
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

720
44:57.536 --> 45:03.615
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

721
45:05.416 --> 45:08.566
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

722
45:08.566 --> 45:10.214
♪Burning bright as a song♪

723
45:10.266 --> 45:13.990
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

724
45:14.368 --> 45:19.034
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

725
45:19.653 --> 45:23.694
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

726
45:24.185 --> 45:26.300
♪Not a single hour less♪

727
45:26.340 --> 45:33.286
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

728
45:34.049 --> 45:37.502
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

729
45:37.682 --> 45:40.827
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

730
45:41.266 --> 45:47.903
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

731
45:48.300 --> 45:50.338
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

732
45:50.338 --> 45:52.814
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

733
45:52.852 --> 45:55.321
♪You're the only one I need♪

734
45:55.525 --> 46:02.412
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

735
46:02.724 --> 46:05.995
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

736
46:06.300 --> 46:09.473
♪My last untouched innocence♪

737
46:09.797 --> 46:13.223
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

738
46:13.456 --> 46:16.681
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

739
46:17.012 --> 46:23.808
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

740
46:24.177 --> 46:26.239
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

741
46:26.240 --> 46:28.743
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

742
46:28.790 --> 46:31.128
♪You're the only one I need♪

743
46:31.359 --> 46:38.194
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

744
46:38.543 --> 46:40.161
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

745
46:40.291 --> 46:42.087
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

746
46:42.444 --> 46:45.461
♪You're the only one I need♪

747
46:45.501 --> 46:46.828
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)
